<div class="email-container">
  <div class="email-card">
    <div class="email-header">
      <h1 class="email-title">邮箱验证</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="email-body">
      <p class="email-text">您好，</p>

      <p class="email-text">请点击下方按钮，确认 <strong><%= @user.email %></strong> 是您的账号邮箱。验证后，若忘记密码，我们将通过此邮箱发送重置链接。</p>

      <div class="email-alert">
        <p class="email-alert-text">请务必点击下方链接完成验证，链接 <strong>2 天</strong>内有效。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="email-button-container">
        <%= link_to "确认使用此邮箱", identity_email_verification_url(sid: @signed_id), class: "email-button" %>
      </div>

      <hr class="email-divider">

      <p class="email-footer">如果您没有进行此操作，请忽略此邮件。如有疑问，请直接回复此邮件联系我们。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
